msgid ""
"Tip: open Glimpse instantly with a gesture.\n"
"\n"
"Set one under Settings → Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → pick a gesture → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(This tip is shown only once.)"
msgstr ""
"Consejo: abre Glimpse al instante con un gesto.\n"
"\n"
"Define uno en Ajustes → Toques y gestos → Gestor de gestos → elige un gesto → Lector → 'Abrir Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(Este consejo se muestra solo una vez.)"

